{
  "id": "LUK.18",
  "number": "18",
  "bookId": "LUK",
  "reference": "Luka 18",
  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "18",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "LUK 18"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "18",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gida sigala masiinung'weanda ea siida laja girgweaguutka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwarukusa ng'asheega nea gagala geat nea gagasa gideaba gaygamiisa saawa mooshta ASEETA galeagasean nea mapura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha, “Aba jeemba mujiinajean gwanda Siisi laja girgweaguutka meawala ASEETA nea maduupa eara sih; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak aba jeedeaba mujiineani gwanda Gatmooni was masiinung'weanda, wuna headaanyi galeaga sean nea gwayeeniisa, ‘Weadaan nung' danyas gidamiisean aba heeda weajoocheandeanyu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea goola gaheewachi, ama muchu gwayeesha geaw, ‘Eara ea meawali ASEETA ghana gheang'ba sihiin, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba goodeawiidan masinung'weanji gaydaadaw gidagasa ea meabuurean aba hituunooda heedeanyu.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Ng'utamiida, “Oaleaydiit ginyaashta Siidida mii doabiiwaat laja girgweaguutkean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gajeeyeena ASEETA mayghoadaw doobiiwnata fugaaschi loosageaw ayeawusa askweari ea eawa? Gayghwashing'da aba weeta nyaawa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geayeeshiineegwa, gayghwalamwach ghoadaw gidamiisa, nea Orjeeda Siida iihidu gayghwadaah masaweega aba jeeda ng'eanyiida?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gida sigala Farisaayajeanda ea siida ang'oonyi gwaadi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu gwarukusa galeega fuga hinda geat gilidoobiiweadi nea gafool suurja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghayi gwanda headi iyeenya siyeang'da gaweay ghamwaash ASEETA aba jeeda gheeda sibata ASEETA, akaleala Farisaayajeanda gil nea niirja ea siida ang'oonyi gwaadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat Farisaayajeanda ak ghamwaashtunu ASEETA aba jeadaanyi, ‘Ea ASEETA, geabadiischooweey aba gideaba aniini meawuurjeewani buuneeda suurja, fuga areedi buuneeda haleanjeeda, ea fuga miidoobiiweadi, ghana fuga mealuuli, nea meawuurjeewani eara siisi ang'oonyi gwaadiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aniini inyeesa gealuuldi geaw nibiyeenya aba jeemba eawooji ispwa, ak aba jeeda gilatamanamughuush bea haleanjeedeanyu, iissa ghaadaydi akaleala.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghamiinaada siidida ang'oonyi gwaadiin nea dildeaweat nea eara gheanyangaaschi ea meageala humng'eeda, gagiisan nea gwayi, ‘ASEETA, bwaydanaan aniini geabea riing'a!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geayeeshiineegwa, ghwararang'aada siidida ang'oonyi gwaadiin gawa gheanyi nea siitaw doobiiwnata ea ghang'al niirja; aba gideaba siida nyooh goodiing'u geaw gajeahiing'u, nea dea hiing'u geaw gajeetiing'u.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghoadaw ghawooda diibiga manang'i",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geeyeassa diibiga ghoadaw ghawooda; daah giinealanga goowoowsa buuneeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaguursa Yesu saawa nea gwayeesha, “Anung'waada diibiga ghapka heedeanyu adoakghuumnyi, aba gideaba gea uurji suh gammiisa sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba huumwa gearukuneegwa gideaba, siida mwadeaptaayda sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA baleanda maygawa jeeda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Siida was meanang'ocheanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghoanyaash siyagi ahaaghwa ng'eanyiida nea gwayeesha, “Giinealshoocheanda miy, gaydasin naaha iijeadanyas eaweega manda muudeanooda?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu niny, “Ghwasaan anda giguureewean siida miy? Manda siida miy geaghus ASEETA ak ghwahit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ginali digheanyeeka: ‘Adimealuuli, adinuusi siida, adijagwadiischi, adimuuwu ng'uyeega, gisisi mureeda gweanu ea geamadu.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha, “Ng'asheesu seaniin naang'waanyi ghang'eada jeepcheanduumeedeanyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiy Yesu ng'asheesu gwayeesha niny, “Ghwashoadeeweey ng'asheanjagi. Shaayda haleanjeadaang'u indeawi sean ak gilakiisi fuga barbari, ak gaynyasa gheaseeda aba humng'eeda, ak guwuni eani geeshteanyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iiy niny ng'asheanji gagiisan, aba gideaba eabaruur muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gang'ula Yesu niny ak gwayeesha, “Ea hang'waaydaan beata jea gaweay meanang'oodiga jeeda sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gajea wusis muuchi gideaba gaygwasik ngamiya seawadeeda sidageeda, maygawuurji beata jea gawa meanang'oocheanda jeeda sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi fugiga iiy nea gwarugu ng'asheanjiin, abeeda iisunu gwanda siida jea ghaghu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha, “Ng'asheega hang'oonyi aba heeda siida aba heeda ASEETA mii hang'waay.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Betaro, “Ng'ula aseasa sinung'wi heeda gealgaasa ak geeyeatu geashtaang'u.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha saawa, “Aba huumwa geayeeshiineegwa, manda siida nung'wa heeda gheanyi, ghana gatmoadaanyi, ghana orjooga ghaamwat, ea fuga jiilu ghana diibiga aba sugoocheanduumeeda ASEETA, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "siisi mwanyasa gea saang'a aba damani bea ghamneawean nea iidu aba damandida jea ghwahiduun, gayghwanyas eaweega manda muudeanooda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu gwarugu deaba samwagu iita miyeadaanyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goobalool ginealangaaschi atamaniyeenya nea gwayeesha, “Ang'ula ghamneawa geescheang'di eeweaya Yerusalemu, ak ng'asheega sean ghayi ng'waar sibanga aba badayda Orjeeda Siida, gaygabiisa ghwahidu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gajeayiin geatinga eemoojiga ak gajeebara reari nea geeng'eawi nea geeng'uriisa ng'usheega; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea gajeabwara mughoowooda, ama ng'ata geenuus, amadu eaweeteaba samwagu gaygwaduudu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea manda siicheeng'u ng'asheesu eara gidawas nea ng'asheanji ea sifunya saawa nea majeeng'na gisibaloola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu ghoahaap siida ng'oaw musiisachi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeyi bwak ama riiksa Yesu Yeriko, gwanda siisi ng'oaw apteada aba gheata naweeda nea gamusiisachi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iidu nea ghwayiiy gidang'ataayda eemeeda ghoanyaashta gideaba Gwanda naaha hiji? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeyeesha, “Ghang'ata Yesuheedida bea Nasaretiin.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gabiissa goojuur nea gwayeesha, “Ea Yesu, Orjeeda Dawdi, eaniyean bwaydanaan!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goojuursa fugiga asheedeawean nea geeyeesha, Siinda; sirukusa ghoaraanya giijuureanda muuchi nea gwayeesha, “Orjeeda Dawdi, eaniyean bwaydanaan!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawus Yesu ak ghwanung' eeyeadu headaanyi. Neekiissa siidida ghoanyaash Yesu nea gwayeesha; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gigasayi dasineey naaha?” Gwayeesha, “Ng'utamiida aniini geagasayi daang'wearda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Yesu niny, “Nyasa giing'weerdeayda; niihaapnyi masaweagaagu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 18:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miighoah gil ghoang'wearda ak ghwaat geeshta nea ghoaghaambiit ASEETA; dea eemeeda ng'asheesu ghoaghaambiit ASEETA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.18.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.18.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
